### Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### ─── Auth ───────────────────────────────────────────────

### Register Owner
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "owner@test.com",
  "password": "Secret123",
  "displayName": "Game Shop",
  "role": "owner"
}

### Login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "owner@test.com",
  "password": "Secret123"
}

### Refresh Token
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{refreshToken}}"
}

### ─── Stores ─────────────────────────────────────────────

### Get all stores (public)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/stores

### Get my stores (owner)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/stores/mine
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Get store by ID (public)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/stores/{{storeId}}

### Create a store (owner)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/stores
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "name": "Pixel Vault",
  "description": "Retro games and consoles",
  "address": "123 Main St",
  "city": "Portland",
  "state": "OR",
  "zipCode": "97201",
  "phone": "503-555-0100",
  "website": "https://pixelvault.example.com"
}

### Update a store (owner)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/stores/{{storeId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "description": "Updated — best retro shop in town!"
}

### Delete a store (owner)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/stores/{{storeId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### ─── Items ──────────────────────────────────────────────

### Get all items for a store (public)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/stores/{{storeId}}/items

### Get single item (public)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/stores/{{storeId}}/items/{{itemId}}

### Create an item (owner)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/stores/{{storeId}}/items
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "title": "Super Mario World",
  "description": "Complete in box, manual included",
  "platform": "SNES",
  "category": "game",
  "condition": "cib",
  "price": 49.99,
  "imageUrls": [],
  "isPromoted": false
}

### Update an item (owner)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/stores/{{storeId}}/items/{{itemId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "isSold": true
}

### Delete an item (owner)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/stores/{{storeId}}/items/{{itemId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### ─── Search ─────────────────────────────────────────────

### Search all available items
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/search

### Search by text query
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/search?query=mario

### Filter by platform
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/search?platform=SNES

### Filter by platform + condition
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/search?platform=SNES&condition=cib

### Price range filter
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/search?minPrice=10&maxPrice=50

### Full search with pagination
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/search?query=mario&platform=SNES&condition=cib&minPrice=10&maxPrice=100&page=1&limit=20

### Search within a specific store
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/search?storeId={{storeId}}&query=zelda
